1
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:09,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Everyone's responsible
for copyright protection.]</font>

2
00:00:09,310 --> 00:00:14,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪After all the joy and sorrow♪</font>

3
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:18,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I still recall your face♪</font>

4
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪You were by my side;
the cool rain fell♪</font>

5
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:30,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I closed my eyes
and heard you sing gently♪</font>

6
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:36,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I'd wager all
for a love that never ends♪</font>

7
00:00:37,150 --> 00:00:40,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪To keep you forever near♪</font>

8
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:47,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In this vast world,
I wait for your light♪</font>

9
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:52,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll share this dream
till dawn is bright♪</font>

10
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:58,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪All the riddles of parting
I'll uncover♪</font>

11
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:01,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪At last, I'll sing, kiss, and hold you♪</font>

12
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:04,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The answer is revealed
within your heart♪</font>

13
00:01:09,720 --> 00:01:12,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Legendary Chitose-Sama]</font>

14
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:16,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Episode 23]</font>

15
00:01:16,200 --> 00:01:17,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The situation outside
is very chaotic now.</font>

16
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:19,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Prince is injured and unconscious.</font>

17
00:01:19,560 --> 00:01:20,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All matters within the residence</font>

18
00:01:21,160 --> 00:01:22,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will follow my orders.</font>

19
00:01:22,880 --> 00:01:23,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Two things.</font>

20
00:01:24,400 --> 00:01:24,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Firstly,</font>

21
00:01:25,600 --> 00:01:26,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">while the Prince is unconscious,</font>

22
00:01:26,920 --> 00:01:27,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we are to receive no visitors.</font>

23
00:01:28,440 --> 00:01:30,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No one is to disturb his recovery.</font>

24
00:01:31,240 --> 00:01:31,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Secondly,</font>

25
00:01:32,840 --> 00:01:33,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">regarding matters within the mansion,</font>

26
00:01:34,040 --> 00:01:35,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I ask everyone to watch their tongues.</font>

27
00:01:36,480 --> 00:01:38,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know the Prince's temperament.</font>

28
00:01:38,800 --> 00:01:40,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If he learns someone has betrayed him,</font>

29
00:01:41,720 --> 00:01:42,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you will bear the consequences.</font>

30
00:01:43,840 --> 00:01:45,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Pass these instructions down.</font>

31
00:01:46,240 --> 00:01:47,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is that understood?</font>

32
00:01:47,400 --> 00:01:47,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

33
00:01:49,080 --> 00:01:49,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You are dismissed.</font>

34
00:01:54,280 --> 00:01:55,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If our parents could see</font>

35
00:01:55,360 --> 00:01:56,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the woman you've become,</font>

36
00:01:56,960 --> 00:01:57,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they would be so proud.</font>

37
00:01:58,120 --> 00:01:59,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now that Changle has fallen,</font>

38
00:01:59,680 --> 00:02:00,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the world outside is in chaos.</font>

39
00:02:01,240 --> 00:02:01,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan's Mansion</font>

40
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:03,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is actually the safest place to be.</font>

41
00:02:04,040 --> 00:02:05,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Perhaps we should decide our next move</font>

42
00:02:05,920 --> 00:02:06,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">after the Prince wakes up.</font>

43
00:02:08,360 --> 00:02:08,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ms. Jun.</font>

44
00:02:09,680 --> 00:02:10,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Duke Dingguo is in the front hall.</font>

45
00:02:10,800 --> 00:02:12,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He says he's here to see the Prince.</font>

46
00:02:13,840 --> 00:02:15,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Beiyuan is in complete chaos now.</font>

47
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:16,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why would Duke Dingguo</font>

48
00:02:16,600 --> 00:02:17,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">come at a time like this?</font>

49
00:02:18,440 --> 00:02:18,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

50
00:02:19,480 --> 00:02:20,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He knows my face.</font>

51
00:02:20,840 --> 00:02:21,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I should hide for now.</font>

52
00:02:36,640 --> 00:02:37,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am Jun Qinglan.</font>

53
00:02:38,120 --> 00:02:39,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Greetings, Duke Dingguo.</font>

54
00:02:39,880 --> 00:02:41,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're the Judicial Review coroner?</font>

55
00:02:43,120 --> 00:02:43,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Indeed, I am.</font>

56
00:02:45,280 --> 00:02:45,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Duke,</font>

57
00:02:46,640 --> 00:02:48,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Prince remains unconscious.</font>

58
00:02:48,800 --> 00:02:49,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Perhaps</font>

59
00:02:50,120 --> 00:02:51,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you could return another day.</font>

60
00:02:51,400 --> 00:02:53,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am here out of concern</font>

61
00:02:53,400 --> 00:02:54,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for Prince Duan's injuries.</font>

62
00:02:55,080 --> 00:02:57,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could I leave without a look?</font>

63
00:02:57,680 --> 00:02:58,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The physician's orders were clear:</font>

64
00:02:58,920 --> 00:03:00,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Prince needs to recover.</font>

65
00:03:01,280 --> 00:03:02,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All these guards following</font>

66
00:03:02,800 --> 00:03:03,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">would be inconvenient.</font>

67
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:04,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why not</font>

68
00:03:04,960 --> 00:03:06,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">leave the guards?</font>

69
00:03:07,240 --> 00:03:08,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then,</font>

70
00:03:08,200 --> 00:03:09,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will escort you inside.</font>

71
00:03:11,520 --> 00:03:12,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since when does my business</font>

72
00:03:13,560 --> 00:03:15,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">require a coroner's approval?</font>

73
00:03:19,120 --> 00:03:19,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Search the place!</font>

74
00:03:20,120 --> 00:03:20,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop!</font>

75
00:03:22,240 --> 00:03:22,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't you dare</font>

76
00:03:23,480 --> 00:03:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">cause trouble in Prince Duan's Mansion!</font>

77
00:03:27,920 --> 00:03:28,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your actions</font>

78
00:03:28,920 --> 00:03:30,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">need no critique from me.</font>

79
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:31,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">However,</font>

80
00:03:31,680 --> 00:03:33,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm in charge here,</font>

81
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:35,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">under the Prince's protection.</font>

82
00:03:35,800 --> 00:03:36,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will never allow</font>

83
00:03:37,040 --> 00:03:39,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">anyone to disturb his recovery.</font>

84
00:03:40,440 --> 00:03:41,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How dare you!</font>

85
00:03:42,840 --> 00:03:44,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A mere coroner</font>

86
00:03:44,520 --> 00:03:45,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">offended me.</font>

87
00:03:47,320 --> 00:03:47,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Guards!</font>

88
00:03:48,280 --> 00:03:49,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Seize her.</font>

89
00:03:49,080 --> 00:03:50,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give her twenty strikes.</font>

90
00:03:50,160 --> 00:03:51,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me see who dares touch her.</font>

91
00:03:51,680 --> 00:03:52,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father!</font>

92
00:03:52,840 --> 00:03:53,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father!</font>

93
00:03:53,560 --> 00:03:54,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are you punishing Jun?</font>

94
00:03:54,800 --> 00:03:55,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you two doing here?</font>

95
00:03:56,120 --> 00:03:56,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father.</font>

96
00:03:56,920 --> 00:03:58,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan is my subordinate.</font>

97
00:03:59,000 --> 00:03:59,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You cannot harm her.</font>

98
00:04:00,160 --> 00:04:00,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief.</font>

99
00:04:01,240 --> 00:04:01,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Ying.</font>

100
00:04:02,120 --> 00:04:03,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You don't need to plead for me.</font>

101
00:04:03,720 --> 00:04:04,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I offended him first.</font>

102
00:04:05,760 --> 00:04:06,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Duke's lesson is well-founded.</font>

103
00:04:07,400 --> 00:04:08,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But here at Prince Duan's Mansion,</font>

104
00:04:09,080 --> 00:04:09,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">even if you strike me,</font>

105
00:04:10,600 --> 00:04:11,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I still cannot let anyone</font>

106
00:04:11,760 --> 00:04:12,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">disturb the Prince's peace.</font>

107
00:04:13,240 --> 00:04:15,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What a sharp-tongued coroner.</font>

108
00:04:16,600 --> 00:04:17,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Today, I shall teach you a proper lesson</font>

109
00:04:17,920 --> 00:04:19,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">on Prince Duan's behalf.</font>

110
00:04:19,480 --> 00:04:20,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take Yufan and Ying away.</font>

111
00:04:21,400 --> 00:04:21,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't you dare!</font>

112
00:04:22,360 --> 00:04:23,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stay back, all of you.</font>

113
00:04:23,200 --> 00:04:23,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Otherwise,</font>

114
00:04:23,880 --> 00:04:24,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll cry for you to see.</font>

115
00:04:25,000 --> 00:04:25,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Preposterous.</font>

116
00:04:26,960 --> 00:04:28,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm here to capture remnants
of Princess Changle.</font>

117
00:04:28,880 --> 00:04:30,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You two cannot stop me.</font>

118
00:04:30,680 --> 00:04:31,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could Prince Duan</font>

119
00:04:32,040 --> 00:04:33,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">harbor fugitives?</font>

120
00:04:34,920 --> 00:04:36,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This person has deep ties
to Prince Duan.</font>

121
00:04:37,320 --> 00:04:39,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In this world, besides Changle,</font>

122
00:04:39,840 --> 00:04:41,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">only Prince Duan would dare shield him.</font>

123
00:04:43,680 --> 00:04:45,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I did not wish to alert you,</font>

124
00:04:46,480 --> 00:04:47,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but this insignificant coroner</font>

125
00:04:47,680 --> 00:04:49,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">insists on meddling and shielding him.</font>

126
00:04:50,040 --> 00:04:51,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even if she's a prince consort,</font>

127
00:04:52,360 --> 00:04:54,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">shielding Princess Changle's aide</font>

128
00:04:54,040 --> 00:04:55,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is still a capital crime.</font>

129
00:04:55,760 --> 00:04:56,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Guards!</font>

130
00:04:56,760 --> 00:04:57,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Seize her.</font>

131
00:04:57,400 --> 00:04:57,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

132
00:04:57,760 --> 00:04:58,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father.</font>

133
00:04:58,280 --> 00:04:58,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

134
00:04:59,160 --> 00:04:59,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You must not.</font>

135
00:05:00,040 --> 00:05:00,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father.</font>

136
00:05:01,760 --> 00:05:02,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Release her.</font>

137
00:05:14,360 --> 00:05:15,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The person you seek, Duke,</font>

138
00:05:16,240 --> 00:05:16,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is me.</font>

139
00:05:17,120 --> 00:05:18,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're really alive!</font>

140
00:05:19,720 --> 00:05:20,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Guards.</font>

141
00:05:20,760 --> 00:05:22,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Seize this fugitive!</font>

142
00:05:23,160 --> 00:05:23,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No!</font>

143
00:05:23,720 --> 00:05:24,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, you mustn't!</font>

144
00:05:25,320 --> 00:05:25,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father.</font>

145
00:05:25,840 --> 00:05:26,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No one shall touch him.</font>

146
00:05:26,920 --> 00:05:27,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ying.</font>

147
00:05:27,880 --> 00:05:28,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

148
00:05:28,960 --> 00:05:29,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is Prince Duan's Mansion.</font>

149
00:05:30,360 --> 00:05:31,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yet you're seizing a man without proof.</font>

150
00:05:32,520 --> 00:05:33,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you considered</font>

151
00:05:33,840 --> 00:05:35,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how to answer to the Prince?</font>

152
00:05:35,440 --> 00:05:36,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Harboring a fugitive,</font>

153
00:05:37,280 --> 00:05:38,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan should consider</font>

154
00:05:38,760 --> 00:05:40,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how to answer for that.</font>

155
00:05:40,800 --> 00:05:42,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're too kind to worry.</font>

156
00:05:46,760 --> 00:05:47,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here in my mansion,</font>

157
00:05:49,160 --> 00:05:50,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I would like to see</font>

158
00:05:51,440 --> 00:05:52,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who dares touch my consort.</font>

159
00:05:56,120 --> 00:05:56,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness!</font>

160
00:06:03,880 --> 00:06:05,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was just about to report
to His Majesty.</font>

161
00:06:06,440 --> 00:06:08,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you insist on an explanation,</font>

162
00:06:09,680 --> 00:06:10,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">come along with me.</font>

163
00:06:16,320 --> 00:06:16,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Majesty,</font>

164
00:06:17,960 --> 00:06:20,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in dismantling
the Princess's faction at court,</font>

165
00:06:21,120 --> 00:06:22,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan's contribution
was indispensable.</font>

166
00:06:23,520 --> 00:06:25,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Though Princess Changle's influence
is purged,</font>

167
00:06:25,720 --> 00:06:27,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">one fugitive is still hidden</font>

168
00:06:27,480 --> 00:06:29,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">within Prince Duan's Mansion.</font>

169
00:06:29,560 --> 00:06:30,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really?</font>

170
00:06:39,720 --> 00:06:41,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is the confession
of Changle's confidant.</font>

171
00:06:42,120 --> 00:06:43,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It states quite clearly</font>

172
00:06:44,440 --> 00:06:45,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that Qin Mobai,
Governor Qin's eldest son,</font>

173
00:06:45,800 --> 00:06:46,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was rescued by Changle five years ago</font>

174
00:06:46,960 --> 00:06:48,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and has been kept confined</font>

175
00:06:48,240 --> 00:06:49,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in her mansion ever since.</font>

176
00:06:50,120 --> 00:06:50,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan took advantage</font>

177
00:06:50,960 --> 00:06:52,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of the recent purge of Princess Changle</font>

178
00:06:52,720 --> 00:06:53,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to rescue him.</font>

179
00:06:54,560 --> 00:06:55,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">At Prince Duan's Mansion,</font>

180
00:06:55,360 --> 00:06:56,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have verified</font>

181
00:06:56,520 --> 00:06:57,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">his identity.</font>

182
00:06:58,400 --> 00:07:00,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This confession is accurate.</font>

183
00:07:00,480 --> 00:07:01,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Majesty, please decide.</font>

184
00:07:06,800 --> 00:07:07,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan.</font>

185
00:07:08,360 --> 00:07:09,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you have to say about this?</font>

186
00:07:10,720 --> 00:07:11,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Duke told the truth.</font>

187
00:07:13,320 --> 00:07:14,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But Your Majesty, do not forget</font>

188
00:07:15,760 --> 00:07:16,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that I've secured
a secret imperial edict</font>

189
00:07:16,840 --> 00:07:18,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of pardon for the Qin family.</font>

190
00:07:18,760 --> 00:07:20,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qin Mobai is now cleared of all charges.</font>

191
00:07:22,000 --> 00:07:23,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How can he be called a fugitive?</font>

192
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:24,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You...</font>

193
00:07:24,720 --> 00:07:26,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You planned this from the start,</font>

194
00:07:27,080 --> 00:07:28,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">even crafting a pretext for it.</font>

195
00:07:35,400 --> 00:07:35,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Majesty,</font>

196
00:07:36,760 --> 00:07:38,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have one more request.</font>

197
00:07:39,000 --> 00:07:39,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What else is there?</font>

198
00:07:40,320 --> 00:07:41,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Speak your mind.</font>

199
00:07:41,680 --> 00:07:42,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want to see</font>

200
00:07:42,320 --> 00:07:43,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how much you've hidden from me.</font>

201
00:07:44,040 --> 00:07:46,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Judicial Review coroner,
granted to me by you,</font>

202
00:07:46,800 --> 00:07:49,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is in truth Qin Wei,
Governor Qin's daughter.</font>

203
00:07:49,840 --> 00:07:51,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She is also my lawfully wedded wife.</font>

204
00:07:53,120 --> 00:07:55,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please restore her true status.</font>

205
00:07:55,560 --> 00:07:57,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan, you have some nerve!</font>

206
00:07:58,040 --> 00:07:59,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is treason
and deceiving the sovereign.</font>

207
00:07:59,680 --> 00:08:01,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Concealing the truth was a last resort.</font>

208
00:08:02,160 --> 00:08:03,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I alone am responsible for this matter.</font>

209
00:08:05,200 --> 00:08:06,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm willing to accept the punishment.</font>

210
00:08:06,400 --> 00:08:07,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Taking all the blame so readily.</font>

211
00:08:08,280 --> 00:08:09,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao,</font>

212
00:08:09,800 --> 00:08:11,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">do you intend to shoulder this alone</font>

213
00:08:11,600 --> 00:08:13,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to absolve
the Qin family of their crimes?</font>

214
00:08:15,520 --> 00:08:16,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Enough.</font>

215
00:08:17,160 --> 00:08:18,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let this matter end here.</font>

216
00:08:18,600 --> 00:08:19,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Majesty.</font>

217
00:08:22,080 --> 00:08:22,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan,</font>

218
00:08:23,960 --> 00:08:25,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">your merit
in dismantling Princess Changle</font>

219
00:08:25,920 --> 00:08:26,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has offset the faults.</font>

220
00:08:28,480 --> 00:08:29,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I shall grant your wish</font>

221
00:08:30,440 --> 00:08:31,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and grant the descendants
of the Qin family their freedom.</font>

222
00:08:32,560 --> 00:08:33,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks for your boundless grace.</font>

223
00:08:43,880 --> 00:08:44,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Only this once.</font>

224
00:08:46,960 --> 00:08:49,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do not let this damage our bond.</font>

225
00:08:50,760 --> 00:08:51,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I acknowledge my fault.</font>

226
00:08:53,720 --> 00:08:54,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You are dismissed.</font>

227
00:09:05,000 --> 00:09:05,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Majesty,</font>

228
00:09:06,720 --> 00:09:08,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is this matter to be settled so easily?</font>

229
00:09:11,440 --> 00:09:12,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Master,</font>

230
00:09:13,520 --> 00:09:14,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am the Emperor.</font>

231
00:09:16,320 --> 00:09:18,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">An edict, once issued,
cannot be taken back.</font>

232
00:09:20,880 --> 00:09:22,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It is just that I never imagined</font>

233
00:09:23,800 --> 00:09:24,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that Prince Duan,</font>

234
00:09:25,640 --> 00:09:26,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this blade of mine,</font>

235
00:09:27,920 --> 00:09:29,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">would turn inward and cut my hand.</font>

236
00:09:30,640 --> 00:09:33,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Prince Duan's Mansion]</font>

237
00:09:49,320 --> 00:09:50,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His Majesty has pardoned</font>

238
00:09:50,120 --> 00:09:51,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the crimes of your family.</font>

239
00:09:51,560 --> 00:09:53,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even if you secured this pardon for us,</font>

240
00:09:53,960 --> 00:09:54,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">do not forget</font>

241
00:09:55,080 --> 00:09:56,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that this is what your family owes us.</font>

242
00:09:58,000 --> 00:09:59,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Though I agreed to let Wei stay for now,</font>

243
00:10:00,200 --> 00:10:00,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that does not mean</font>

244
00:10:01,720 --> 00:10:02,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I consent to your marriage.</font>

245
00:10:04,600 --> 00:10:05,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do I need your consent?</font>

246
00:10:08,280 --> 00:10:08,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

247
00:10:09,600 --> 00:10:10,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai.</font>

248
00:10:17,320 --> 00:10:18,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dressed like this,</font>

249
00:10:18,960 --> 00:10:19,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">don't I look lovely?</font>

250
00:10:20,080 --> 00:10:20,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You do.</font>

251
00:10:24,000 --> 00:10:25,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His Majesty has pardoned our family.</font>

252
00:10:25,960 --> 00:10:27,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can finally be Qin Wei again.</font>

253
00:10:27,840 --> 00:10:29,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No more hiding.</font>

254
00:10:30,040 --> 00:10:30,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you both</font>

255
00:10:31,440 --> 00:10:32,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">not happy?</font>

256
00:10:33,400 --> 00:10:34,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We are.</font>

257
00:10:35,320 --> 00:10:37,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then we must celebrate.</font>

258
00:10:37,720 --> 00:10:39,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've had the servants
prepare wine and food.</font>

259
00:10:39,960 --> 00:10:41,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tonight, the three of us
will drink till dawn.</font>

260
00:10:44,440 --> 00:10:45,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Ying.</font>

261
00:10:45,760 --> 00:10:46,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are those gifts of yours enough?</font>

262
00:10:47,160 --> 00:10:48,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If they're not,</font>

263
00:10:48,320 --> 00:10:49,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can prepare some more for you.</font>

264
00:10:50,760 --> 00:10:51,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yufan,</font>

265
00:10:51,480 --> 00:10:53,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">look at my new hairstyle.</font>

266
00:10:53,600 --> 00:10:55,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's the trendiest noble lady's attire.</font>

267
00:10:56,120 --> 00:10:56,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take a good look.</font>

268
00:10:59,240 --> 00:11:00,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Any difference?</font>

269
00:11:00,840 --> 00:11:01,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Talking to you is pointless.</font>

270
00:11:02,320 --> 00:11:03,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Like casting pearls before swine.</font>

271
00:11:04,920 --> 00:11:06,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I thought you had no one you fancied.</font>

272
00:11:07,120 --> 00:11:08,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who are you dressing up for?</font>

273
00:11:09,120 --> 00:11:10,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That was before.</font>

274
00:11:10,880 --> 00:11:13,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can't I fall for someone now?</font>

275
00:11:13,560 --> 00:11:14,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've fallen for someone?</font>

276
00:11:16,080 --> 00:11:17,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's not Li Congyao, is it?</font>

277
00:11:17,440 --> 00:11:18,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me tell you.</font>

278
00:11:18,600 --> 00:11:19,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's no good.</font>

279
00:11:19,600 --> 00:11:20,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you dare fall for him,</font>

280
00:11:20,720 --> 00:11:21,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll shave your head clean.</font>

281
00:11:21,880 --> 00:11:23,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll send you to Mount Emei to be a nun.</font>

282
00:11:24,320 --> 00:11:26,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not fighting Jun for a man.</font>

283
00:11:27,160 --> 00:11:28,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want to become</font>

284
00:11:28,520 --> 00:11:30,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">part of her family.</font>

285
00:11:30,560 --> 00:11:31,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Her family?</font>

286
00:11:33,240 --> 00:11:34,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't tell me it's Qinglan's brother.</font>

287
00:11:35,320 --> 00:11:36,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even you think he's</font>

288
00:11:37,280 --> 00:11:38,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">dashing and elegant,</font>

289
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:40,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with an extraordinary presence?</font>

290
00:11:40,920 --> 00:11:42,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His presence is a bit less than mine.</font>

291
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:44,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You two are completely wrong
for each other.</font>

292
00:11:45,720 --> 00:11:46,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How are we wrong for each other?</font>

293
00:11:47,440 --> 00:11:48,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Am I</font>

294
00:11:48,760 --> 00:11:49,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that terrible?</font>

295
00:11:50,200 --> 00:11:51,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's not about being terrible.</font>

296
00:11:51,440 --> 00:11:52,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You two are just not right together.</font>

297
00:11:53,240 --> 00:11:54,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's involved in unspeakable affairs</font>

298
00:11:55,360 --> 00:11:56,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with Princess Changle.</font>

299
00:11:57,680 --> 00:11:59,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know all about what you're saying.</font>

300
00:12:00,040 --> 00:12:02,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My friends gossiped it all
to me ages ago.</font>

301
00:12:03,240 --> 00:12:04,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So what?</font>

302
00:12:04,400 --> 00:12:05,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So what?</font>

303
00:12:06,480 --> 00:12:07,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You two can never be together.</font>

304
00:12:07,720 --> 00:12:08,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Enough.</font>

305
00:12:08,920 --> 00:12:10,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't worry about me.</font>

306
00:12:11,160 --> 00:12:13,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">At least I have someone in my heart.</font>

307
00:12:14,440 --> 00:12:15,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Unlike you.</font>

308
00:12:18,160 --> 00:12:19,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Before we eat,</font>

309
00:12:19,400 --> 00:12:20,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">let's have a drink first.</font>

310
00:12:21,120 --> 00:12:22,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To celebrate the three of us</font>

311
00:12:22,480 --> 00:12:23,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">enduring many hardships</font>

312
00:12:23,800 --> 00:12:24,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and reuniting after so long.</font>

313
00:12:26,240 --> 00:12:26,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

314
00:12:28,080 --> 00:12:29,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To our family reunion.</font>

315
00:12:30,760 --> 00:12:31,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei,</font>

316
00:12:31,960 --> 00:12:33,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I toast to you becoming Qin Wei again.</font>

317
00:12:37,720 --> 00:12:39,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You two should clink glasses too.</font>

318
00:12:44,640 --> 00:12:45,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here, eat up.</font>

319
00:12:46,400 --> 00:12:47,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These are all your favorites.</font>

320
00:12:47,640 --> 00:12:48,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have some more.</font>

321
00:12:48,680 --> 00:12:49,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei,</font>

322
00:12:49,360 --> 00:12:50,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">eat more.</font>

323
00:12:50,840 --> 00:12:51,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look how thin you've become.</font>

324
00:12:52,160 --> 00:12:52,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How about this?</font>

325
00:12:53,000 --> 00:12:54,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tomorrow, we'll return to Guanzhou.</font>

326
00:12:54,800 --> 00:12:55,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll find a physician</font>

327
00:12:55,680 --> 00:12:56,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to nurse you back to health.</font>

328
00:12:57,280 --> 00:12:58,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The physicians in Yanjing</font>

329
00:12:58,280 --> 00:12:59,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are far more skilled
than those in Guanzhou.</font>

330
00:13:00,200 --> 00:13:00,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei,</font>

331
00:13:01,200 --> 00:13:02,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">tomorrow, I'll summon</font>

332
00:13:02,120 --> 00:13:04,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">all the physicians from miles around</font>

333
00:13:04,320 --> 00:13:04,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to perform pulse diagnoses for you.</font>

334
00:13:06,400 --> 00:13:08,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My health is perfectly fine.</font>

335
00:13:09,960 --> 00:13:11,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then just eat more.</font>

336
00:13:12,040 --> 00:13:12,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Build up your strength.</font>

337
00:13:22,880 --> 00:13:23,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

338
00:13:23,720 --> 00:13:24,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm tired.</font>

339
00:13:24,440 --> 00:13:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Help me back to rest.</font>

340
00:13:26,080 --> 00:13:26,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

341
00:13:27,120 --> 00:13:28,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My wound aches a little.</font>

342
00:13:28,400 --> 00:13:29,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Help me change the dressing.</font>

343
00:13:30,280 --> 00:13:31,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait. What are you doing?</font>

344
00:13:31,920 --> 00:13:32,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We haven't even eaten yet.</font>

345
00:13:33,240 --> 00:13:34,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We can skip the meal.</font>

346
00:13:38,040 --> 00:13:38,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun.</font>

347
00:13:39,280 --> 00:13:39,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun.</font>

348
00:13:41,600 --> 00:13:42,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry up.</font>

349
00:13:42,440 --> 00:13:42,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief.</font>

350
00:13:42,960 --> 00:13:43,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ying.</font>

351
00:13:44,120 --> 00:13:44,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've come at the perfect time.</font>

352
00:13:45,000 --> 00:13:45,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Join us for a meal.</font>

353
00:13:46,960 --> 00:13:47,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun.</font>

354
00:13:47,760 --> 00:13:49,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You look stunning dressed up.</font>

355
00:13:49,800 --> 00:13:50,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

356
00:13:51,560 --> 00:13:52,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Beautiful.</font>

357
00:13:53,440 --> 00:13:55,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at you, so smitten.</font>

358
00:13:58,280 --> 00:13:58,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well.</font>

359
00:13:59,200 --> 00:14:00,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My brother and I</font>

360
00:14:00,400 --> 00:14:02,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">came to apologize for our father.</font>

361
00:14:03,520 --> 00:14:04,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He</font>

362
00:14:04,480 --> 00:14:05,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">came here</font>

363
00:14:05,400 --> 00:14:06,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and disturbed your peace.</font>

364
00:14:07,040 --> 00:14:08,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I must apologize to you.</font>

365
00:14:08,440 --> 00:14:09,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm sorry.</font>

366
00:14:11,080 --> 00:14:12,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't mention it.</font>

367
00:14:12,240 --> 00:14:13,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was worried</font>

368
00:14:13,320 --> 00:14:15,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you'd be upset that I hid my identity.</font>

369
00:14:15,080 --> 00:14:16,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As long as you're not angry with me.</font>

370
00:14:17,880 --> 00:14:18,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief,</font>

371
00:14:18,920 --> 00:14:20,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you've arrived at the perfect time.</font>

372
00:14:20,280 --> 00:14:20,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Help me.</font>

373
00:14:20,960 --> 00:14:21,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait a moment.</font>

374
00:14:22,320 --> 00:14:24,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I came today to speak
with the Prince privately.</font>

375
00:14:24,640 --> 00:14:25,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

376
00:14:26,240 --> 00:14:27,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">may I have a word in private?</font>

377
00:14:35,480 --> 00:14:35,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun,</font>

378
00:14:36,560 --> 00:14:38,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I brought some top-quality bird's nest</font>

379
00:14:38,440 --> 00:14:39,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to nourish
the Prince's blood and health.</font>

380
00:14:40,160 --> 00:14:42,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Could I trouble you
to warm it in the kitchen?</font>

381
00:14:43,120 --> 00:14:43,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Alright.</font>

382
00:14:44,800 --> 00:14:45,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now?</font>

383
00:14:46,400 --> 00:14:47,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, right now.</font>

384
00:14:48,080 --> 00:14:49,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's in the front hall. Go on.</font>

385
00:14:49,480 --> 00:14:50,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right now.</font>

386
00:14:50,200 --> 00:14:51,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry for the trouble.</font>

387
00:14:51,640 --> 00:14:52,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Alright.</font>

388
00:15:01,800 --> 00:15:02,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Whatever you have to say,</font>

389
00:15:03,120 --> 00:15:03,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">say it here.</font>

390
00:15:07,480 --> 00:15:09,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How are your wounds?</font>

391
00:15:12,440 --> 00:15:14,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have suffered more wounds in battle</font>

392
00:15:14,440 --> 00:15:15,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">than meals you've ever eaten.</font>

393
00:15:16,240 --> 00:15:17,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's hardly worth mentioning.</font>

394
00:15:18,640 --> 00:15:20,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Must you always be so smug?</font>

395
00:15:20,600 --> 00:15:22,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You think I actually care about you?</font>

396
00:15:22,640 --> 00:15:23,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me tell you something.</font>

397
00:15:23,680 --> 00:15:25,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You'd better live a long life</font>

398
00:15:31,320 --> 00:15:32,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and treat her well.</font>

399
00:15:43,320 --> 00:15:45,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He makes it sound
like I stole his woman.</font>

400
00:15:57,960 --> 00:15:59,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei was truly out of line.</font>

401
00:15:59,760 --> 00:16:01,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could she leave you
waiting here for so long?</font>

402
00:16:01,800 --> 00:16:02,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll go call her.</font>

403
00:16:03,480 --> 00:16:04,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why?</font>

404
00:16:04,760 --> 00:16:05,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's in the way.</font>

405
00:16:06,200 --> 00:16:07,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In the way?</font>

406
00:16:10,600 --> 00:16:11,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm saying</font>

407
00:16:11,840 --> 00:16:13,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that I need to talk to you.</font>

408
00:16:13,960 --> 00:16:14,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's right.</font>

409
00:16:17,560 --> 00:16:18,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Qin.</font>

410
00:16:18,640 --> 00:16:19,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our meeting</font>

411
00:16:19,640 --> 00:16:21,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">must truly be fate.</font>

412
00:16:21,680 --> 00:16:23,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was wondering</font>

413
00:16:23,280 --> 00:16:24,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">about your name before.</font>

414
00:16:25,160 --> 00:16:26,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What a surprise</font>

415
00:16:26,520 --> 00:16:28,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that you are Jun's brother.</font>

416
00:16:28,800 --> 00:16:29,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Truly, fate brings together</font>

417
00:16:29,680 --> 00:16:30,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">those a thousand miles apart.</font>

418
00:16:31,120 --> 00:16:31,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't you agree?</font>

419
00:16:33,320 --> 00:16:34,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss, I have been</font>

420
00:16:34,600 --> 00:16:36,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">most discourteous to you.</font>

421
00:16:36,360 --> 00:16:37,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I hope you can forgive me.</font>

422
00:16:37,640 --> 00:16:38,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please,</font>

423
00:16:38,760 --> 00:16:40,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">stop</font>

424
00:16:40,120 --> 00:16:41,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">those humble words.</font>

425
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:43,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun and I are the same age.</font>

426
00:16:44,320 --> 00:16:45,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How about</font>

427
00:16:46,440 --> 00:16:48,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I call you Mobai instead?</font>

428
00:16:48,640 --> 00:16:49,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Alright.</font>

429
00:16:49,240 --> 00:16:50,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai.</font>

430
00:16:50,840 --> 00:16:51,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That sounds so lovely.</font>

431
00:16:52,680 --> 00:16:53,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai,</font>

432
00:16:53,920 --> 00:16:55,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is there a wife waiting for you at home?</font>

433
00:16:55,720 --> 00:16:56,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Or a young lady who has caught your eye?</font>

434
00:16:57,680 --> 00:16:58,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">May I visit you</font>

435
00:16:58,600 --> 00:17:00,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">often from now on?</font>

436
00:17:04,720 --> 00:17:05,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai,</font>

437
00:17:05,640 --> 00:17:07,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what do you enjoy doing
in your spare time?</font>

438
00:17:07,520 --> 00:17:08,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Reading, calligraphy, painting,</font>

439
00:17:09,000 --> 00:17:10,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or perhaps sword practice?</font>

440
00:17:10,640 --> 00:17:11,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Allow me to tell you</font>

441
00:17:11,240 --> 00:17:12,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what I like to do in my spare time.</font>

442
00:17:12,760 --> 00:17:13,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well, to be honest,</font>

443
00:17:13,960 --> 00:17:15,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my interests are quite varied.</font>

444
00:17:15,960 --> 00:17:17,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I enjoy exploring fine cuisine.</font>

445
00:17:21,340 --> 00:17:23,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll see all the world's sights♪</font>

446
00:17:24,210 --> 00:17:25,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Drifting with the clouds♪</font>

447
00:17:25,880 --> 00:17:29,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Leave our names etched
in each other's hearts♪</font>

448
00:17:29,800 --> 00:17:34,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Bright as a goddess, stirring my soul♪</font>

449
00:17:34,480 --> 00:17:37,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Each stroke inscribed
into the passing years♪</font>

450
00:17:38,470 --> 00:17:42,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪A sky full of stars covers
the peach blossom spring♪</font>

451
00:17:42,990 --> 00:17:47,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪With you, hand in hand
across the vast world♪</font>

452
00:17:47,320 --> 00:17:52,970
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No words needed,
our hearts mirror each other♪</font>

453
00:17:55,460 --> 00:17:59,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Catching a teardrop on my fingertip♪</font>

454
00:18:00,130 --> 00:18:03,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Then gently caressing your face♪</font>

455
00:18:04,180 --> 00:18:08,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We await mercy
as the rain flutters down♪</font>

456
00:18:08,730 --> 00:18:11,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪This floating life
is like a myriad of dreams♪</font>

457
00:18:12,700 --> 00:18:16,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No matter how far the journey,
our passion endures♪</font>

458
00:18:17,310 --> 00:18:21,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Let's turn a blind eye
to all the gossip and rumors♪</font>
